<SiteLayout title="About" description="About Kroma Digital and our approach to building practical digital tools for Cambodia.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">About Kroma Digital</span><h1>Local problems. Practical software.</h1><p>Kroma Digital builds focused Android apps and lightweight digital tools around real needs in Cambodia.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Why we started</h2><p>Small businesses often manage important work through paper, spreadsheets, chat messages, or a mixture of disconnected tools. Our goal is not to add more complexity. We look for specific problems where a simple digital tool can save time, reduce mistakes, or make daily work easier.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>We listen first, validate the need, build a focused first version, and improve it from real feedback. We prefer a useful small product over a large product filled with features people do not need.</p><h2>Who we build for</h2><p>Our primary focus is Cambodian users and small businesses. Products are designed with local workflows, language needs, mobile usage, and practical affordability in mind.</p><h2>What we build</h2><p>Our work includes Android applications and lightweight web or digital tools for areas such as expense tracking, seller operations, records, inventory, booking, education, and other everyday workflows.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>